{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3000_place", "source_sha256": "9c03fcb601a76830674d913893b0d3b6eb3718ae1827e3fa5ce5db86d1a41cf6", "ja": "TV局スタジオ", "zh": "电视台摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3001_052kao", "source_sha256": "758252ad6e87686ea0408cd97660ee87dfc42f38a48fc3172e19f6c67c1fa77a", "ja": "今日の私のお仕事は、\nコントに登場する歌のお姉さん、でしたね。", "zh": "我今天的工作\n是在短剧中登场的唱歌的大姊姊，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3002_052kao", "source_sha256": "35548c8ccb478962cff592196b4f5a2dbdc444dc6f572b4c1a03b2052de1d836", "ja": "ふふっ、とっても楽しみです。皆さんに、\n笑っていただくために歌うなんて……はじめて♪", "zh": "呵呵，我非常期待呢，为了让大家\n露出笑容而歌唱……这还是第一次♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3003_p", "source_sha256": "15511b62f2ac7c89bafb6dc335b7db0abc0219d80fdc9a34fbd9785d87539ea2", "ja": "歌織さんがやる気で、何よりです。\nいいコントにしましょう！", "zh": "歌织小姐本人有干劲是再好不过了。\n演出最棒的短剧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3004_052kao", "source_sha256": "75d0b33e09b6a6aeddfe2080da521ef0eaeb72438968574cba4a6c025bea431a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nそのことで私、少し考えてみたんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n关于这件事，我有个想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3005_052kao", "source_sha256": "48b6077884b9d9652b45e13216d4da517c1d769e3e0143cf4263208afcfb68d5", "ja": "皆さんの笑顔のために、歌い方も少し、\n変えてみた方がいいのかしらって……どう思いますか？", "zh": "为了大家的笑容，我在想，是不是应该\n稍微改变一下唱歌方式……你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3006_p", "source_sha256": "535ad5c428d4ace88d1fd0be8401094d93740b05fd7816e690fca754471cc097", "ja": "そうですね。\nそれじゃ、こういう感じで……。", "zh": "我想想，\n那就走这种路线好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3007", "source_sha256": "ed7039032cd6135dfaadaa1bdf7a4ec25f50500954f56dda695ff79c6f55cd14", "ja": "アイドルらしく", "zh": "偶像风格", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3008", "source_sha256": "619c48fe8652ad51c453cf84aaf48006a005e19933262f4449de0a5a6283f375", "ja": "歌織さんらしく", "zh": "歌织小姐的风格", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3200_p", "source_sha256": "5c7664d258efe8c55dd66eaf0285d9cf4f07b573224aff89bda2bfee35a90b81", "ja": "アイドルらしく歌いましょう。\n視聴者の笑顔が目に浮かびます！", "zh": "用偶像风格来歌唱吧。\n我现在就可以想像出观众的笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3201_052kao", "source_sha256": "445a6171588eee425bf7c4a9dab041b1b9306bc4dd8e9d1a8fe9131b61fca6ac", "ja": "アイドル……わかりました。では、笑顔で歌いますね！\nちょうちょ、ちょうちょ、菜の葉にとまれ♪", "zh": "偶像……我明白了，那就带着笑容唱歌吧！\n蝴蝶～蝴蝶～生得真美丽♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3202_052kao", "source_sha256": "14614b69216a6f61b37ed4681da100a4dd14b4efb0052aed039eb0af4bf51edd", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか私が楽しい気持ちに……。\n皆さんにも伝えられるよう、頑張りますね！", "zh": "呵呵，总觉得我自己变得也好开心……\n我会加油，把这份快乐也传递给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3300_p", "source_sha256": "5c7664d258efe8c55dd66eaf0285d9cf4f07b573224aff89bda2bfee35a90b81", "ja": "アイドルらしく歌いましょう。\n視聴者の笑顔が目に浮かびます！", "zh": "用偶像风格来歌唱吧。\n我现在就可以想像出观众的笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3301_052kao", "source_sha256": "43f379f9e2706d63bcf182805c157d6facf4b1c4dc0fdb82b4390113ee5e2144", "ja": "アイドル……で、では、できるだけかわいい声でっ。\nう……うさぎお～いし、かの山～……ぁ……。", "zh": "偶像……那、那就尽可能用可爱的声音唱。\n从……从前追野～兔的那座山～……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3302_052kao", "source_sha256": "d6958ae2752641070f7bc75fdb4935e4c5c6094638f5040742b671af4f59cbda", "ja": "だ、ダメ……っ。\nなんだか、とっても……恥ずかしいです……っ。", "zh": "不、不行……\n总觉得非常……非常害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3500_p", "source_sha256": "7086f086458aa676ed71cde0171c48850175329bdfb1b846b16b3daf6baf1930", "ja": "歌織さんらしく、いつも通りに歌いましょう。\nそれが一番だと思います！", "zh": "和平常一样，用歌织小姐的风格唱歌吧。\n我认为那是最好的做法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3501_052kao", "source_sha256": "f082227e947bb618e43e1c29ac20d1fd08459be533b9fb5a6a1902fb7f427ea1", "ja": "いつも通りに……。では、子ども達に教えるように。\nはい、むーすーんで、ひーらーいーて♪", "zh": "和平常一样……那就像是教小朋友那样。\n来，握──起──拳──头，打──开──手──心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3502_052kao", "source_sha256": "4fa825d8f3ecea64c1e8c85a0ecd70e56fefb9b6233a1e21d11817c8af83f61f", "ja": "あっ。{$P$}さん、みんなの笑顔が\n……たくさん浮かんできました。ふふっ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，我的脑海里……\n也浮现大家的笑容了，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3600_p", "source_sha256": "7086f086458aa676ed71cde0171c48850175329bdfb1b846b16b3daf6baf1930", "ja": "歌織さんらしく、いつも通りに歌いましょう。\nそれが一番だと思います！", "zh": "和平常一样，用歌织小姐的风格唱歌吧。\n我认为那是最好的做法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3601_052kao", "source_sha256": "dadc6235e8ed91e679d22fb875f03e41bdb421f4462fb15e214c2b02e0fa5372", "ja": "いつも通りに……。では、オペラ風に歌ってみますね。\nシャボン玉飛んだ、屋根まで飛んだ～……。", "zh": "和平常一样……那我就用歌剧风格唱唱看吧。\n泡泡飞起来，飞到屋顶上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_052kao_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_052kao_3602_052kao", "source_sha256": "f9fc236d229d8eeaba76062846951fe993350ee24a9122af89c0ac33adcfe21a", "ja": "あの……。これではスタジオが……\n静寂につつまれませんか……？", "zh": "那个……我这样唱，摄影棚……\n不会变得一片沉寂吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
